we often have this sense that the world  is depending on us that we were born  into this world for a specific purpose  that we must accomplish and contribute  to some bigger story that everything we  do is incredibly important however if we  took a moment to look down at the dirt  and up at the stars with a little  examination we quickly realize that we  barely have any idea what we are looking  at and that perhaps we are wrong in our  feeling that we are fundamentally  important to anything beyond ourselves  as humans we are merely a blink in the  universe's seemingly indiscernible story  we live on a tiny wet rock rotating  around a star in a single part of a  single galaxy in a group of other  galaxies amongst thousands of other  groups of galaxies known as galaxy  clusters and the galaxy cluster we are  in is amongst thousands of more clusters  all of which make up what we believe to  be the universe something so large and  perplexing the human brain can't even  comprehend any of what was just said  based on science this whole universe  thing started 13.7 billion years ago  expanding out of the Big Bang it is also  believed that from this moment right now  the universe will continue for some more  billions of years and then its energy  will burn out and everything will end in  what science is coining the big freeze  the strangest part in all of this is  that we don't even know if any of what  we think we know is true in any case it  is fair to argue that if any of this is  even close to true essentially nothing  we do in our life matters to anything  beyond ourselves that we are an  insignificant and mean  be strung along by an indifferent  universe that cares very little about  our opinions hopes accomplishments and  failures the idea that we are not  important and that nothing we do matters  to anything beyond us might sound  upsetting and disappointing at first  however it is incredibly liberating our  common delusion that we know what we are  doing and why we are doing it that  illusion that what we do will matter to  the universe or some discernible bigger  story this delusion brings on a level of  anxiety guilt and pressure that can  never be satiated an unnecessary and  never-ending need to achieve higher and  higher levels of things regardless of  what is good for us or what we truly  want to do with our life in recognizing  everyone's fundamental unimportance and  the absurdity of everything the weight  of the universe slides off our shoulders  the pressure of needing to do anything  specific or to live life any certain way  releases from our consciousness  realizing this does not suggest that we  should just give up and sit on the couch  and do nothing it does however suggest  that we can and should intentionally  choose what we wish to do with our lives  and not succumb to any social or  psychological pressure to live any other  way  ironically the beauty of living on a  planet in a universe where we don't  matter much if at all is that if there  is no inherent meaning to our life we  get to decide what means what to us we  get to decide how we want to live  therefore we must examine deeply and  patiently into ourselves and discover  what it is we wish to do with our life  not what the universe wishes to do with  it not what other people wish to do with  but what we wish to do with it despite  what our psychology and culture might  often try to convince us we don't  necessarily need to pursue the highest  position in our career field we don't  necessarily need to scale our business  we don't necessarily need to become  world famous for our art we can do or  try to do these things if we want but we  must honestly consider how these things  will affect our lives before deciding if  we want to do them and in the process  also realize that if we do or don't do  them  we remain just as important and  unimportant as anyone else there is only  one reason to do anything instead of  nothing in life it is not wealth fame  status or power it is finding a sense of  energy connection expression and  enjoyment in the action of doing the  things we choose to do life is far more  flexible to our wishes than we often  think so long as we are willing to make  the right sacrifices for many of us we  can live life how we would like to in  order to do so though we must emit any  and all of the extra nonsense that  people have told us is important but  isn't to us and find what is important  to us and do that in the end so long as  you find financial comfort so long as  you feel engaged in your life and so  long as you aren't harming anybody along  the way you've done as much as anyone  can ever do and you can stop feeling  guilty about needing to do more whenever  you'd like  [Music]  thank you for watching if he found  enjoyment and value in this video please  give it a thumbs up share your thoughts  in the comments below and if you are not  already be sure to subscribe to our  channel we are constantly coming out  with new videos to help you experience  life with clarity and Wonder
 

